    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel 7 girls crashland into an uninhabited planet, now it\u2019s up to you to take them to safety...\u00a0 Or not! The only thing sure is there is going to be sex involved. Multiple routes good and bad so you can take the story in your own direction aside from forming the relationships you want.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/ab33946b49568c1b617db691acbc62be.avif?t=1747318574\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The good choice is always easy to see, but can the girls do it? Manage the group\u2019s willpower, some choices aren\u2019t easy to make for the girls and there is where the willpower points enter! Depending on each girl\u2019s traits some of the options will cost willpower and most of those options will lead to better results, but on the other side the easy way will get some willpower, it\u2019s up to you to manage it!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/e104478bd1d35444c1d79c0812ebbc8a.poster.avif?t=1747318574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/e104478bd1d35444c1d79c0812ebbc8a.webm?t=1747318574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/e104478bd1d35444c1d79c0812ebbc8a.mp4?t=1747318574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course this is a life or death situation, so expect bad endings but don\u2019t worry you won\u2019t get a surprise bad ending because you made a bad choice 3 hours ago. Bad endings are easy to spot and most of the time will go against the girl\u2019s self preservation instinct so you won\u2019t be locked into a bad ending, on the other side if you want to see what happens you\u2019ll know when it\u2019s time to save.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/92edd4894586c022de8edbbdd312718a.avif?t=1747318574\" width=800 height=910 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is bad, choose who will end up with who. There are many combinations between the girls wanting Luna, the catgirl to end up with Esmeralda, the teacher? We got that, but what if you want Luna to end up with Denisse, the four armed girl and Esmeralda with Gigi, the slime girl? Of course you can! There are a lot of combinations to enjoy during a playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel 7 girls crashland into an uninhabited planet, now it\u2019s up to you to take them to safety...\u00a0 Or not! The only thing sure is there is going to be sex involved. Multiple routes good and bad so you can take the story in your own direction aside from forming the relationships you want.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/ab33946b49568c1b617db691acbc62be.avif?t=1747318574\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The good choice is always easy to see, but can the girls do it? Manage the group\u2019s willpower, some choices aren\u2019t easy to make for the girls and there is where the willpower points enter! Depending on each girl\u2019s traits some of the options will cost willpower and most of those options will lead to better results, but on the other side the easy way will get some willpower, it\u2019s up to you to manage it!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/e104478bd1d35444c1d79c0812ebbc8a.poster.avif?t=1747318574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/e104478bd1d35444c1d79c0812ebbc8a.webm?t=1747318574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/e104478bd1d35444c1d79c0812ebbc8a.mp4?t=1747318574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course this is a life or death situation, so expect bad endings but don\u2019t worry you won\u2019t get a surprise bad ending because you made a bad choice 3 hours ago. Bad endings are easy to spot and most of the time will go against the girl\u2019s self preservation instinct so you won\u2019t be locked into a bad ending, on the other side if you want to see what happens you\u2019ll know when it\u2019s time to save.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339730/extras/92edd4894586c022de8edbbdd312718a.avif?t=1747318574\" width=800 height=910 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is bad, choose who will end up with who. There are many combinations between the girls wanting Luna, the catgirl to end up with Esmeralda, the teacher? We got that, but what if you want Luna to end up with Denisse, the four armed girl and Esmeralda with Gigi, the slime girl? Of course you can! There are a lot of combinations to enjoy during a playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
